1
00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:42,970
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,330 --> 00:01:46,009
[Episode 24]

3
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:49,479
I'd rather spend the rest of my life
in a temple

4
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,900
than be forced to become a concubine!

5
00:01:56,950 --> 00:01:58,410
This is a joyous occasion.

6
00:01:58,590 --> 00:01:59,680
Don't be insolent.

7
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:02,120
Listen up, all of you!

8
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,640
I, Xie Qingyuan,

9
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:06,200
hereby call off my marriage to Li Congxin,
the Heir

10
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,660
of the Marquis of Danyang!

11
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,840
I will not marry him!

12
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,440
Qingyuan.

13
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,080
Fourth Sister.

14
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,210
You rebellious son!

15
00:02:18,710 --> 00:02:19,560
Father.

16
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:21,000
Father.

17
00:02:21,470 --> 00:02:22,360
Kneel!

18
00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:25,710
Father!

19
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,360
Nanny Liu.

20
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:28,280
Father.

21
00:02:34,870 --> 00:02:35,630
Fourth Lady.

22
00:02:36,310 --> 00:02:37,170
Don't touch me!

23
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,030
Let go of me!

24
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:38,750
Let go of me!

25
00:02:38,750 --> 00:02:39,630
Fourth Lady,

26
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,560
a concubine like you
can't wear bridal robes.

27
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:44,310
This attire of yours is more dignified
than even the principal wife's.

28
00:02:44,310 --> 00:02:46,150
This servant will teach you a lesson

29
00:02:46,150 --> 00:02:48,150
and rid you of any notion
that you can overstep your station,

30
00:02:48,150 --> 00:02:50,520
lest you enter the Marquis's household
without knowing your place!

31
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,280
Let go of me.

32
00:02:51,470 --> 00:02:53,000
Who do you think you are?

33
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:53,750
Let go of me!

34
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:56,910
Let go of me!

35
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,560
How dare you try to
vie with our Second Lady?

36
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,290
I'd say you've got a death wish!

37
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,630
Let go of me!

38
00:03:40,079 --> 00:03:41,240
Fourth Lady,

39
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,270
this servant still remembers

40
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:47,240
those 30 slaps quite vividly.

41
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:56,800
Let's go.

42
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:13,360
Get away from me!

43
00:04:13,470 --> 00:04:14,310
Get away from me!

44
00:04:14,310 --> 00:04:15,000
-Qingyuan!
-Chunzhi!

45
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,860
Don't come any closer, all of you!

46
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,120
Whoever dares come near,

47
00:04:20,510 --> 00:04:22,630
I'll pierce a hole in your neck!

48
00:04:52,190 --> 00:04:53,510
-Move!
-Out of the way!

49
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:23,640
♪ I counted every moment ♪

50
00:05:23,710 --> 00:05:27,800
♪ Memories take root;
the annual rings grow ♪

51
00:05:27,820 --> 00:05:32,030
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

52
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:36,440
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

53
00:05:36,460 --> 00:05:41,130
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

54
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,200
Qingyuan.

55
00:05:41,150 --> 00:05:45,590
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

56
00:05:45,620 --> 00:05:52,270
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

57
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,000
What are you doing here?

58
00:05:52,300 --> 00:05:55,940
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

59
00:05:55,960 --> 00:06:01,560
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

60
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:00,900
Commander,

61
00:06:01,580 --> 00:06:05,820
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

62
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:04,120
you've barged into
the Marquis's wedding hall,

63
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,240
and now you're embracing
the Heir's concubine.

64
00:06:05,860 --> 00:06:10,220
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

65
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:09,070
Isn't this rather improper?

66
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:11,070
Your family and Li family

67
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:14,700
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

68
00:06:11,750 --> 00:06:13,950
are willing to let such a gem be sullied.

69
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:14,870
But I

70
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:18,950
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

71
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:18,040
cannot bear to see the woman I love
reduced to a concubine.

72
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,310
The woman you love?

73
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:23,540
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

74
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:22,270
Commander, surely you're not trying to

75
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,270
snatch her in front of everyone?

76
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:27,880
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

77
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,680
You speak too gravely, Lord Xie.

78
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,920
This isn't seizing her.

79
00:06:27,910 --> 00:06:33,659
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

80
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,800
I'm asking for her hand in marriage.

81
00:07:04,910 --> 00:07:11,800
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

82
00:07:11,830 --> 00:07:19,070
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

83
00:07:19,090 --> 00:07:22,450
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

84
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:26,180
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

85
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:33,050
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

86
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:29,510
Son.

87
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:30,600
Chunzhi.

88
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:40,480
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

89
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:47,510
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

90
00:07:47,570 --> 00:07:51,380
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

91
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,040
I offer this red cloak
as your wedding robe

92
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:54,870
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

93
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,950
and ask you

94
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:55,920
to become my wife.

95
00:07:54,930 --> 00:08:02,280
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

96
00:07:58,040 --> 00:08:00,360
Offering the red wedding robe is a rite
for a woman marrying beneath her station.

97
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,270
Commander,

98
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:03,510
you're lowering your status.

99
00:08:02,310 --> 00:08:08,950
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

100
00:08:07,510 --> 00:08:09,000
Amid the flames of calamity,
fate entrusted you to me;

101
00:08:08,970 --> 00:08:16,220
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

102
00:08:09,310 --> 00:08:11,480
Once, before the Buddha,
our incense rose as one.

103
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,950
By the windy window,
we revisit old promises;

104
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:14,870
Counting worn silver,
awaiting our coming spring.

105
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:16,870
May parted stars shine together once more,
defying Heaven's decree;

106
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:19,950
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

107
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,920
May broken jade be made whole again,
beyond what mortals can foresee.

108
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,070
With reverence,
I make this vow before your spirit.

109
00:08:19,980 --> 00:08:23,400
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

110
00:08:21,070 --> 00:08:22,480
Let peach blossoms
bear witness to our oath.

111
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,240
Long ago, our hearts
were woven into silken gauze.

112
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:30,530
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

113
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:26,680
I have carved our promise into stone
and sealed it in wood,

114
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,750
thus keeping the vow we made as youths
beneath the locust tree.

115
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:29,870
I have sought an auspicious match

116
00:08:29,870 --> 00:08:30,950
and now pledge to
nurture our bond forever.

117
00:08:30,590 --> 00:08:38,240
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

118
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,630
With six gifts of betrothal,
I come before your hall.

119
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:34,000
I do not presume to boast of my honor.

120
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,750
I look to the paired swallows
circling your roof

121
00:08:35,750 --> 00:08:37,350
and await an auspicious day.

122
00:08:37,390 --> 00:08:38,440
Golden daylilies grace the northern hall;

123
00:08:38,260 --> 00:08:45,350
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

124
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,440
I humbly ask that
you graciously accept this proposal.

125
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,750
A fine jade tree awaits
in the eastern chamber;

126
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:41,960
I reverently present the ceremonial geese.

127
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,480
Shen Run, of the Shen clan of the capital,

128
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,510
humbly bows twice.

129
00:08:44,510 --> 00:08:45,960
The sixteenth day of the second month,

130
00:08:45,370 --> 00:08:49,450
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

131
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,560
in the eighth year of Jingxi.

132
00:08:49,470 --> 00:08:52,710
♪ The homeward boat glides slowly
through dark twilight ♪

133
00:08:52,730 --> 00:08:58,470
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

134
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,240
Commander,

135
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:06,180
you've really thought this through?

136
00:09:07,150 --> 00:09:07,910
Yes.

137
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,520
Have you considered—

138
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,730
if we don't get along

139
00:09:17,150 --> 00:09:18,630
in the future,

140
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:21,530
might you come to regret this?

141
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,750
Even so,

142
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:24,930
I accept that risk.

143
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,200
Please do me the honor

144
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:36,100
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

145
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,840
of becoming my wife.

146
00:09:31,790 --> 00:09:32,510
I, Shen Run,

147
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,100
will never have any complaints or regrets.

148
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:42,790
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

149
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:46,620
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

150
00:09:46,690 --> 00:09:50,120
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

151
00:09:50,180 --> 00:09:57,370
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

152
00:09:57,390 --> 00:10:04,000
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

153
00:10:04,050 --> 00:10:11,470
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

154
00:10:11,490 --> 00:10:15,200
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

155
00:10:15,230 --> 00:10:18,760
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

156
00:10:15,870 --> 00:10:17,330
[Chen family of Hengtang]

157
00:10:18,890 --> 00:10:25,790
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

158
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,320
Unfilial daughter!

159
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:33,490
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

160
00:10:26,790 --> 00:10:28,750
You are a daughter of the Xie family.

161
00:10:28,750 --> 00:10:30,390
Without our permission,

162
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:32,000
you've pledged yourself to him

163
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:33,030
and signed the marriage contract!

164
00:10:33,030 --> 00:10:34,390
Do you know that you've defied

165
00:10:33,510 --> 00:10:40,070
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

166
00:10:34,390 --> 00:10:36,190
all proper order and tradition?

167
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:40,090
You people of the Xie family
have misunderstood.

168
00:10:40,090 --> 00:10:44,280
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

169
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,140
The woman I'm seeking to marry

170
00:10:42,390 --> 00:10:43,390
is surnamed Chen,

171
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:44,870
not Xie.

172
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:47,760
♪ The homeward boat glides slowly
through dark twilight ♪

173
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,240
Preposterous.

174
00:10:47,630 --> 00:10:49,150
I'm the patriarch of the Xie family.

175
00:10:47,790 --> 00:10:55,020
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

176
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:50,960
Qingyuan,

177
00:10:51,910 --> 00:10:53,910
how dare you try to change your surname.

178
00:10:53,910 --> 00:10:55,390
I'll give you one last chance.

179
00:10:55,040 --> 00:11:03,320
♪ I chant and sigh; one cup of spring,
drunk through turns of year ♪

180
00:10:55,870 --> 00:10:56,960
Come here now,

181
00:10:57,630 --> 00:10:58,830
and I'll forgive you.

182
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,390
Let's go.

183
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:01,880
Let's go home.

184
00:11:06,150 --> 00:11:08,750
Commissioner Hu has arrived!

185
00:11:19,420 --> 00:11:21,740
[Hu Xing, Head of Three Commissioners]

186
00:11:22,670 --> 00:11:23,670
Brother!

187
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:25,790
Brother.

188
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,120
Commissioner Hu,

189
00:11:32,870 --> 00:11:35,730
here you are, showing up
without any warning at all.

190
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,720
Brother,

191
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,480
Qingyuan

192
00:11:57,870 --> 00:12:00,440
has already been entered into
our Xie family genealogy.

193
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:02,360
Alive, she belongs to the Xie family;

194
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,030
dead, she is a ghost of the Xie family.

195
00:12:04,030 --> 00:12:07,080
Today, our patriarch betrothed Qingyuan

196
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:09,200
to the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang
as a concubine.

197
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:11,120
It should've been a joyous occasion—

198
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,790
a double blessing.

199
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:16,550
But unexpectedly, Commander Shen

200
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,660
barged into the wedding hall.

201
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:20,320
Not only did he snatch Qingyuan away,

202
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:22,520
but he also tried to change her surname.

203
00:12:22,870 --> 00:12:26,150
It's simply... too much for us to bear.

204
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:29,320
I hope you'll stand up for us, Brother.

205
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,270
Such a thing happened?

206
00:12:45,790 --> 00:12:47,990
Where is the gift I bought for my sister?

207
00:12:58,390 --> 00:12:59,480
Your favorite

208
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,320
when you were little.

209
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:10,860
Thank you for always
keeping me in your thoughts, Brother.

210
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:18,960
Commander Shen,

211
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:23,380
looks like your marriage
won't be going through after all.

212
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,600
I've long heard

213
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:31,000
that you have an extraordinary presence,
Commissioner Hu.

214
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,640
Now that I've seen you today,

215
00:13:32,670 --> 00:13:34,630
you indeed live up to your reputation.

216
00:13:34,630 --> 00:13:36,230
I'm determined to marry her.

217
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,750
You, a mere commissioner—

218
00:13:37,750 --> 00:13:39,960
do you really think
you can stop the Palace Guards

219
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:41,550
and me by yourself?

220
00:13:48,270 --> 00:13:49,200
I came here today

221
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,840
without a single soldier.

222
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,370
How could I possibly

223
00:13:52,630 --> 00:13:55,630
stop the Palace Guards,
who stormed through Hengtang

224
00:13:56,150 --> 00:13:57,790
with such might

225
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,840
just days ago?

226
00:14:13,620 --> 00:14:14,710
[Memorial; Your subject, Li Shaoqun]

227
00:14:22,810 --> 00:14:24,210
[Increase pay to stabilize the army.]
[The wounded shall receive double pay for life.]

228
00:14:26,390 --> 00:14:26,850
Well...

229
00:14:28,390 --> 00:14:29,390
Commissioner Hu,

230
00:14:29,390 --> 00:14:31,150
isn't this the memorial

231
00:14:31,390 --> 00:14:35,120
I submitted to the imperial court
regarding soldiers' pay some time ago?

232
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:36,980
How did it come to be in your hands?

233
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,260
The Marquis of Danyang

234
00:14:42,630 --> 00:14:45,080
wants to refine the armor for the troops

235
00:14:45,270 --> 00:14:48,080
in his camp and raise their pay,

236
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:52,670
so His Lordship has repeatedly
requested funds.

237
00:14:54,030 --> 00:14:55,030
As luck would have it,

238
00:14:55,030 --> 00:14:55,870
this memorial

239
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,120
just

240
00:14:57,910 --> 00:14:59,910
landed right on my desk.

241
00:15:05,870 --> 00:15:06,670
But

242
00:15:07,390 --> 00:15:08,670
as you all know,

243
00:15:09,030 --> 00:15:11,320
the court has many demands for funding.

244
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,860
I'm also in a difficult position.

245
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,750
But if

246
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:18,910
both of my nieces

247
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,910
marry your son,

248
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:23,480
wouldn't we be even closer?

249
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:24,840
Yes.

250
00:15:26,670 --> 00:15:28,360
Then, whether in the court's interest
or my own,

251
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:30,240
I'll approve it, even though we're kin.

252
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:32,550
Let people say whatever they please.

253
00:15:32,910 --> 00:15:35,480
You can be sure

254
00:15:35,910 --> 00:15:37,370
I'll put your needs first.

255
00:15:40,630 --> 00:15:41,630
Commissioner Hu,

256
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:42,910
are you trying to use

257
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,840
the soldiers' pay

258
00:15:45,390 --> 00:15:46,510
to threaten me?

259
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,220
Your Lordship,

260
00:15:54,450 --> 00:15:59,220
I'm genuinely concerned for your sake.

261
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:03,910
You've

262
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:06,530
guarded this place for many years.

263
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:08,900
Your soldiers' equipment

264
00:16:09,150 --> 00:16:11,080
should've been replaced long ago.

265
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:13,630
During the last raid
by the northern bandits,

266
00:16:13,630 --> 00:16:16,510
many soldiers lost their lives
because their armor

267
00:16:16,510 --> 00:16:17,510
was too fragile.

268
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:19,200
If we don't replace
the military equipment,

269
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:21,390
the soldiers will lose their morale.

270
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:25,030
How will we
safeguard the peace of the people?

271
00:16:26,550 --> 00:16:27,910
We might as well disband

272
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:29,480
your army!

273
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:38,960
Soldiers!

274
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,360
Yes, sir!

275
00:16:58,010 --> 00:16:59,050
Commander Shen,

276
00:16:59,550 --> 00:17:02,390
you're a guest here in Hengtang.

277
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:03,840
I should've

278
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:06,800
shown you proper hospitality long ago.

279
00:17:07,270 --> 00:17:08,470
Today's show of force

280
00:17:08,589 --> 00:17:09,790
is the welcoming gift

281
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:12,109
I've prepared especially for you.

282
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:15,000
You should be able to see clearly

283
00:17:15,829 --> 00:17:18,030
how we receive guests here in Hengtang.

284
00:17:18,349 --> 00:17:19,550
You're a clever man.

285
00:17:20,270 --> 00:17:22,400
Do you understand?

286
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:40,780
Soldiers,

287
00:17:41,030 --> 00:17:43,960
you've faithfully followed
His Lordship for years!

288
00:17:44,030 --> 00:17:46,350
You don't want to
see him humiliated, do you?

289
00:17:46,350 --> 00:17:48,010
Then what are you waiting for?

290
00:17:48,510 --> 00:17:49,770
Get the concubine back

291
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:52,400
for Young Master Li!

292
00:17:57,060 --> 00:17:57,960
Don't worry.

293
00:17:58,550 --> 00:17:59,640
You're my wife.

294
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:02,250
I won't let your reputation be tarnished.

295
00:18:08,350 --> 00:18:09,750
I'd like to see who dares.

296
00:18:21,110 --> 00:18:22,640
Here's the imperial edict!

297
00:18:22,720 --> 00:18:24,680
Lay down your arms, remove your armor,

298
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:26,010
and kneel to receive it!

299
00:18:34,070 --> 00:18:34,790
What?

300
00:18:35,270 --> 00:18:38,470
Are you going to defy
an imperial edict, Commissioner Hu?

301
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:53,450
This subject

302
00:18:54,750 --> 00:18:55,880
receives the edict.

303
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:09,200
By the Mandate of Heaven, I decree:

304
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:10,790
Xie Qingyuan,
fourth daughter of the Xie family,

305
00:19:10,790 --> 00:19:12,000
is pure and virtuous.

306
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,640
It grieves this throne that legitimate

307
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:15,550
and concubine-born daughters
are worlds apart.

308
00:19:15,550 --> 00:19:18,200
The whole Xie clan allowed their servants
to abuse the lonely girl,

309
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,350
which is truly a grave violation
of human decency.

310
00:19:19,350 --> 00:19:21,960
Now, Shen Run,
Commander of the Palace Guard,

311
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:23,350
has distinguished himself
through meritorious service

312
00:19:23,350 --> 00:19:25,480
and has submitted his heartfelt petition
before the throne.

313
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,960
This throne, moved by his plea,

314
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,350
grants marriage between Shen and Qingyuan.

315
00:19:28,350 --> 00:19:30,550
The Court of Imperial Sacrifices
shall select an auspicious date

316
00:19:30,550 --> 00:19:32,110
and prepare the betrothal rites
according to protocol.

317
00:19:32,110 --> 00:19:34,240
Xie Qingyuan shall be removed
from the Xie family register.

318
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:36,550
Her name shall be struck
from the Xie genealogy,

319
00:19:36,550 --> 00:19:37,830
and she shall return to the Chen family.

320
00:19:37,830 --> 00:19:40,510
She shall be granted the title of
Second-Rank Lady of Honor,

321
00:19:40,510 --> 00:19:42,350
together with 100 qing of fertile land

322
00:19:42,350 --> 00:19:44,010
and golden phoenix hairpins.

323
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:46,220
Spring, in the eighth year of Jingxi.

324
00:20:18,350 --> 00:20:19,280
Commander Shen.

325
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:23,070
You truly are a trusted confidant
close to the throne.

326
00:20:23,070 --> 00:20:24,470
I honestly didn't expect

327
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:27,960
you to be so favored by the Emperor.

328
00:20:31,110 --> 00:20:32,430
Likewise.

329
00:20:34,310 --> 00:20:36,440
I didn't want things to come to this.

330
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:38,590
But you

331
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:40,070
left me no choice.

332
00:20:40,830 --> 00:20:42,400
Since that's how things stand,

333
00:20:42,400 --> 00:20:44,400
and today is an auspicious day,

334
00:20:45,830 --> 00:20:46,880
I might as well

335
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:49,610
borrow the wedding arrangements already

336
00:20:49,790 --> 00:20:52,270
set up here for my own marriage.

337
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:57,960
You have the imperial edict to shield you;

338
00:20:57,960 --> 00:21:00,590
I have no objections.

339
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:09,310
But a wedding without elders present

340
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:14,070
will invite the wrath of Heaven.

341
00:21:17,110 --> 00:21:18,970
Hurry, we can't afford to be late.

342
00:21:22,550 --> 00:21:23,640
My goodness!

343
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:25,430
Look at this spectacle!

344
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:42,960
This chair...

345
00:21:45,790 --> 00:21:47,240
I-I'm not late, am I?

346
00:21:48,030 --> 00:21:48,550
Well...

347
00:21:52,550 --> 00:21:53,550
Let's begin.

348
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:55,000
Okay.

349
00:21:56,310 --> 00:21:57,440
Bride and groom,

350
00:21:57,550 --> 00:21:59,030
bow to Heaven and Earth!

351
00:22:03,590 --> 00:22:04,640
Bow!

352
00:22:10,070 --> 00:22:11,510
Second bow to the elder—

353
00:22:12,790 --> 00:22:15,050
may you enjoy family happiness forever!

354
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:21,680
Bow!

355
00:22:30,510 --> 00:22:31,590
Great.

356
00:22:33,680 --> 00:22:35,610
Bride and groom, bow to each other—

357
00:22:35,830 --> 00:22:38,030
may blessing and peace be with you both!

358
00:22:56,790 --> 00:22:57,920
The ceremony is complete!

359
00:22:57,920 --> 00:23:02,720
Great!

360
00:24:02,350 --> 00:24:04,980
Well, I came at a bad time.

361
00:24:06,920 --> 00:24:09,790
But I wanted you to try

362
00:24:09,790 --> 00:24:11,790
the osmanthus candies I just made.

363
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:12,640
These were

364
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:14,680
her favorite when she was little.

365
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:15,830
She used to sneak them all the time,

366
00:24:15,830 --> 00:24:17,480
and I caught her every time.

367
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:21,440
These are your wedding candies.

368
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:24,480
Make sure you eat them, okay?

369
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:30,720
You two,

370
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:32,150
what's going on here?

371
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:35,350
Why are you sitting
so formally and stiffly?

372
00:24:35,350 --> 00:24:36,890
Why so tense?

373
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:39,440
You two are married now.

374
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:42,310
Why are you still shy
like a pair of children?

375
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:45,160
Seriously.

376
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:49,610
Seeing you two finally married

377
00:24:49,960 --> 00:24:51,070
makes me happier

378
00:24:51,070 --> 00:24:52,960
than anything.

379
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:55,070
Everyone says that

380
00:24:55,590 --> 00:24:59,250
by changing her red-and-blue wedding robes
to a blood-red cloak,

381
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:03,160
you turned a marriage
above her station into one below it, Yan.

382
00:25:03,440 --> 00:25:04,590
But I think,

383
00:25:04,960 --> 00:25:06,350
in today's wedding,

384
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:07,270
Yan, you

385
00:25:07,830 --> 00:25:09,360
gave her plenty of dignity.

386
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:19,680
It's... Second-Rank Lady of Honor,

387
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:20,790
right?

388
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:25,010
Second-Rank Lady of Honor!

389
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:27,640
That's certainly something to boast about!

390
00:25:27,640 --> 00:25:29,880
I mean, it's such an honor!

391
00:25:34,000 --> 00:25:34,800
From now on...

392
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:38,110
I'll have plenty to brag about

393
00:25:38,110 --> 00:25:39,510
to all the neighbors.

394
00:25:43,640 --> 00:25:44,720
I almost forgot

395
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:46,180
the most important thing—

396
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:48,830
I still need to

397
00:25:48,830 --> 00:25:50,400
go make the bed for you.

398
00:26:26,720 --> 00:26:27,590
My Lady,

399
00:26:27,960 --> 00:26:30,890
how about I help you
take off the phoenix crown first?

400
00:26:44,070 --> 00:26:45,350
I'm really here.

401
00:26:47,510 --> 00:26:51,310
I've become the Heir's Consort
of the Marquis of Danyang household.

402
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:54,270
I really married Chunzhi.

403
00:26:55,680 --> 00:26:58,480
It's already past midnight,

404
00:26:58,550 --> 00:27:00,150
and the Heir hasn't come yet.

405
00:27:00,440 --> 00:27:02,440
Should we send someone to fetch him?

406
00:27:04,720 --> 00:27:06,960
He must be caught up with the guests.

407
00:27:08,790 --> 00:27:09,830
He's the Heir,

408
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:12,320
and today is his wedding day.

409
00:27:13,310 --> 00:27:16,710
Naturally, everyone wants to
offer their congratulations.

410
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:18,110
But...

411
00:27:19,000 --> 00:27:22,160
But after everything, this marriage
hasn't exactly gone smoothly.

412
00:27:22,160 --> 00:27:24,830
What if he doesn't come at all tonight?

413
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:41,560
If he doesn't come today...

414
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:45,130
then I'll wait until tomorrow.

415
00:27:54,720 --> 00:27:55,400
I have a...

416
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:57,550
a whole lifetime...

417
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:01,510
to wait.

418
00:28:05,590 --> 00:28:06,400
My Lady.

419
00:28:45,030 --> 00:28:45,720
Che,

420
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:49,260
I know what you're worried about.

421
00:28:50,550 --> 00:28:52,720
You're worried
that I've forgotten my mission—

422
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:54,450
forgotten what we set out to do.

423
00:28:55,680 --> 00:28:56,740
Good that you know.

424
00:28:57,960 --> 00:29:00,310
Feng En has already reported
that your lovely wife

425
00:29:00,310 --> 00:29:02,310
intends to move against Xie Shu.

426
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:05,660
This is not what His Majesty wants to see.

427
00:29:06,920 --> 00:29:07,640
And you—

428
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:13,000
you actually asked for an edict
to snatch her in a moment of desperation.

429
00:29:13,590 --> 00:29:15,350
Are you afraid
that His Majesty won't notice

430
00:29:15,350 --> 00:29:17,680
that you also want to
move against Xie Shu?

431
00:29:23,510 --> 00:29:24,640
Do you know

432
00:29:25,310 --> 00:29:27,700
how afraid I've been every day?

433
00:29:28,310 --> 00:29:29,680
Afraid that one day, we'd never be able

434
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:31,510
to finish what we set out to do!

435
00:29:35,750 --> 00:29:37,750
What is it that we truly set out to do?

436
00:29:39,310 --> 00:29:40,510
Along the way,

437
00:29:42,110 --> 00:29:44,170
how long were we destitute refugees,

438
00:29:45,590 --> 00:29:47,250
how many places did we flee to,

439
00:29:48,070 --> 00:29:49,670
and how many people helped us

440
00:29:50,830 --> 00:29:52,430
so that we could escape death

441
00:29:52,830 --> 00:29:54,160
and live to see this day?

442
00:29:58,310 --> 00:29:59,790
We've seen so much hatred,

443
00:30:01,350 --> 00:30:02,590
so much vengeance.

444
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:09,740
After everything we've endured,

445
00:30:12,350 --> 00:30:13,510
we're no longer

446
00:30:15,550 --> 00:30:17,950
seeking revenge merely for the Shen family

447
00:30:19,590 --> 00:30:21,030
but for the whole realm.

448
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:24,030
I believe in our father

449
00:30:27,070 --> 00:30:29,330
and in every soul the candles represent.

450
00:30:31,030 --> 00:30:32,430
This was their wish.

451
00:30:43,900 --> 00:30:49,670
[Shen Residence]

452
00:30:57,550 --> 00:31:02,090
[Shen Residence]

453
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:20,890
[Shen Residence]

454
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:21,400
Nine years.

455
00:32:23,160 --> 00:32:24,820
Since I returned to Hengtang,

456
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:26,970
I've walked every corner of it,

457
00:32:27,480 --> 00:32:29,880
yet I've never dared to
push open this door.

458
00:32:31,480 --> 00:32:32,680
If it weren't for you,

459
00:32:33,680 --> 00:32:36,140
I don't think I would've ever
returned here.

460
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:42,350
I never told you

461
00:32:42,350 --> 00:32:43,950
why I have to protect Xie Shu.

462
00:32:45,720 --> 00:32:48,070
But when I saw you were about to
marry another man,

463
00:32:48,070 --> 00:32:49,270
I couldn't accept it.

464
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:53,540
So I asked His Majesty for an edict

465
00:32:54,720 --> 00:32:56,030
to keep you by my side.

466
00:32:56,750 --> 00:32:57,510
Now,

467
00:32:58,680 --> 00:33:00,200
I can tell you everything.

468
00:33:01,310 --> 00:33:02,830
My resolve for vengeance

469
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:06,120
never wavered, not for a single moment.

470
00:33:06,350 --> 00:33:08,240
Nor could 9 years of my efforts

471
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:11,060
be erased by a single imperial edict.

472
00:33:11,880 --> 00:33:12,790
It's because I know

473
00:33:12,790 --> 00:33:15,050
I still have more important things to do.

474
00:33:15,590 --> 00:33:17,250
That's why I have no choice but

475
00:33:17,880 --> 00:33:20,010
to spare Xie Shu's life a while longer—

476
00:33:20,480 --> 00:33:21,340
causing you...

477
00:33:23,550 --> 00:33:26,270
and the 72 deceased members of our family

478
00:33:27,880 --> 00:33:29,210
to wait a little longer.

479
00:33:33,160 --> 00:33:34,240
This courtyard

480
00:33:35,510 --> 00:33:38,710
was once filled with magnolia trees
that my mother loved.

481
00:33:38,750 --> 00:33:42,080
She loved the season
when the flowers bloomed and then fell.

482
00:33:42,440 --> 00:33:43,640
We could smell

483
00:33:45,030 --> 00:33:45,960
their fragrance

484
00:33:46,830 --> 00:33:48,510
before we even reached home.

485
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:52,750
Until that day,

486
00:33:52,750 --> 00:33:54,550
my father and I went to your home.

487
00:33:57,070 --> 00:33:59,070
Before the flowers could even fall,

488
00:34:00,440 --> 00:34:01,790
our family fell first.

489
00:34:10,150 --> 00:34:12,110
Our entire household was wiped out.

490
00:34:12,110 --> 00:34:13,440
And the root of it all...

491
00:34:15,880 --> 00:34:18,010
was one new policy my father proposed.

492
00:34:19,710 --> 00:34:21,480
Displaced refugees could be resettled,

493
00:34:21,480 --> 00:34:22,880
wasteland reclaimed,

494
00:34:22,880 --> 00:34:24,280
commoners granted land,

495
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:26,510
and taxes and labor duties
fairly apportioned.

496
00:34:26,510 --> 00:34:28,760
All these entrenched abuses—
from noble families concealing land

497
00:34:28,760 --> 00:34:30,889
to wealthy households evading taxes—

498
00:34:30,920 --> 00:34:32,120
could be eradicated.

499
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:34,630
The power held by officials

500
00:34:34,920 --> 00:34:36,580
and the fate of common people—

501
00:34:36,880 --> 00:34:39,030
could all be reckoned anew.

502
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:41,420
But, My Lord, your reforms

503
00:34:41,440 --> 00:34:43,440
will surely offend all of Hengtang.

504
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:43,880
No,

505
00:34:44,480 --> 00:34:46,340
they will offend the whole world.

506
00:34:46,360 --> 00:34:47,840
Knowing the world carries
such deep-rooted ailments,

507
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:49,840
how can we just live on
in comfortable indifference?

508
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:51,730
If it's destined that some must die

509
00:34:51,730 --> 00:34:53,190
for the new policy to move forward,

510
00:34:53,190 --> 00:34:56,650
I, Shen Zhibai, am willing to
be the first to give my life for it!

511
00:35:05,510 --> 00:35:06,760
The new policy

512
00:35:07,710 --> 00:35:08,760
of equalization

513
00:35:09,480 --> 00:35:13,190
shall survey the land, equalize taxes,

514
00:35:13,550 --> 00:35:15,760
reform the corvée,
and establish a fair grain levy,

515
00:35:15,760 --> 00:35:18,320
thereby easing the burden on the people.

516
00:35:19,280 --> 00:35:20,760
"Survey the land, equalize taxes,

517
00:35:20,760 --> 00:35:21,590
reform the corvée,
and establish a fair grain levy,

518
00:35:21,590 --> 00:35:23,190
thereby easing the burden on the people."

519
00:35:23,190 --> 00:35:25,650
Until the day he died,
my father kept saying,

520
00:35:26,230 --> 00:35:28,480
"When the flowers fall
and nourish the earth,

521
00:35:28,480 --> 00:35:30,740
next year they'll bloom more brightly."

522
00:35:31,070 --> 00:35:32,280
He believed his death

523
00:35:33,280 --> 00:35:35,280
was like a seed planted in the earth.

524
00:35:35,400 --> 00:35:36,460
Once it blossomed,

525
00:35:37,880 --> 00:35:41,080
it might put an end to
Hengtang's endless cycle of famine.

526
00:35:45,670 --> 00:35:46,840
But after he died,

527
00:35:48,590 --> 00:35:49,960
no one remembered him

528
00:35:51,880 --> 00:35:53,540
or even wanted to mention him.

529
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:56,030
The seed he planted

530
00:35:58,150 --> 00:36:00,410
seemed to have died in Hengtang long ago.

531
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:04,260
Of course, I hate those
who caused his death.

532
00:36:05,190 --> 00:36:07,120
But I understand even more clearly

533
00:36:09,150 --> 00:36:12,080
that fulfilling my father's dying wish
matters more

534
00:36:14,070 --> 00:36:15,670
than destroying my enemies.

535
00:36:19,070 --> 00:36:19,880
I believe

536
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:24,220
this is what he would
want me to do as well.

537
00:36:25,960 --> 00:36:27,710
I chose this path

538
00:36:29,360 --> 00:36:31,360
not simply because he was my father,

539
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:32,960
but because...

540
00:36:34,510 --> 00:36:35,440
he was right.

541
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,660
I should've realized it long ago.

542
00:36:42,760 --> 00:36:44,020
Whether you're Yan Rui

543
00:36:44,630 --> 00:36:45,590
or Shen Run,

544
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:48,480
whether you're a corrupt official

545
00:36:48,480 --> 00:36:49,810
or a ruthless enforcer,

546
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:51,550
beneath that mask,

547
00:36:52,440 --> 00:36:53,840
you are still the same man

548
00:36:54,230 --> 00:36:57,550
determined to transform Hengtang.

549
00:36:59,000 --> 00:37:00,260
You've never changed.

550
00:37:00,440 --> 00:37:01,840
You're still the Shen Run

551
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:04,400
I waited for 9 years in the ruined temple—

552
00:37:04,880 --> 00:37:06,630
the one who saved me as a child

553
00:37:07,150 --> 00:37:08,840
and gave me hope to live.

554
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:16,190
Now that

555
00:37:16,880 --> 00:37:17,880
we are married,

556
00:37:18,590 --> 00:37:19,440
we are family.

557
00:37:20,480 --> 00:37:21,550
The road you have chosen

558
00:37:21,550 --> 00:37:22,550
is mine as well.

559
00:37:23,230 --> 00:37:23,880
I think

560
00:37:24,590 --> 00:37:27,110
this is also
what my mother would want to see.

561
00:37:28,110 --> 00:37:31,240
This is far more important
than our personal vendettas.

562
00:37:31,680 --> 00:37:38,860
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

563
00:37:34,960 --> 00:37:36,360
We got married so hastily

564
00:37:37,550 --> 00:37:38,400
that I never had the time

565
00:37:38,400 --> 00:37:39,960
to get us a new residence—

566
00:37:38,890 --> 00:37:45,510
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

567
00:37:40,550 --> 00:37:42,150
a place we could call our own.

568
00:37:45,610 --> 00:37:53,250
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

569
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:48,880
Why not build our home right here?

570
00:37:53,370 --> 00:38:00,670
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

571
00:37:58,930 --> 00:38:01,800
[Shen Residence]

572
00:38:00,810 --> 00:38:07,740
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

573
00:38:07,840 --> 00:38:18,020
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

574
00:38:18,200 --> 00:38:25,380
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

575
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:19,480
Stop.

576
00:38:22,710 --> 00:38:23,770
You're a grown man,

577
00:38:24,630 --> 00:38:26,440
yet you don't even have the courage
to enter your own home?

578
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:32,570
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

579
00:38:29,880 --> 00:38:31,760
Once I've accomplished
what I set out to do,

580
00:38:31,760 --> 00:38:33,150
I'll naturally come back
to console our family's spirits.

581
00:38:32,600 --> 00:38:36,180
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

582
00:38:34,190 --> 00:38:34,800
I know.

583
00:38:36,200 --> 00:38:39,820
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

584
00:38:36,800 --> 00:38:38,600
Except for you and your brother,

585
00:38:39,070 --> 00:38:41,190
everyone else in your family
died 9 years ago.

586
00:38:39,850 --> 00:38:46,260
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

587
00:38:41,920 --> 00:38:42,630
But now...

588
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:47,650
your family has a third member.

589
00:38:49,400 --> 00:38:50,360
From now on,

590
00:38:52,000 --> 00:38:53,860
you'll have more family members.

591
00:38:54,280 --> 00:38:55,610
And this Shen Residence

592
00:38:56,440 --> 00:38:58,040
will take on a whole new look.

593
00:38:58,800 --> 00:39:01,110
But if you never dare to
walk through this door,

594
00:39:01,110 --> 00:39:02,150
this courtyard

595
00:39:01,550 --> 00:39:08,020
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

596
00:39:02,920 --> 00:39:05,070
will remain forever
as it lives in your memory—

597
00:39:05,070 --> 00:39:06,360
soaked in blood.

598
00:39:08,130 --> 00:39:15,290
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

599
00:39:15,470 --> 00:39:22,830
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

600
00:39:22,940 --> 00:39:30,110
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

601
00:39:30,220 --> 00:39:37,520
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

602
00:39:37,110 --> 00:39:37,710
Brother.

603
00:39:37,640 --> 00:39:46,830
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

604
00:39:41,550 --> 00:39:42,210
Let me do it.

605
00:39:48,940 --> 00:39:55,560
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

606
00:40:02,280 --> 00:40:05,480
Congratulations on your wedding,
Commander.

607
00:40:07,840 --> 00:40:08,800
Though

608
00:40:09,840 --> 00:40:11,590
I wonder if you've been so dazzled
by your beautiful bride

609
00:40:11,590 --> 00:40:12,920
that you've lost your senses.

610
00:40:12,920 --> 00:40:14,480
His Majesty granting your personal wish

611
00:40:14,480 --> 00:40:16,710
was already an extraordinary act of grace.

612
00:40:16,710 --> 00:40:17,400
Yet you've

613
00:40:19,030 --> 00:40:20,990
leaked his top-secret mission

614
00:40:21,020 --> 00:40:22,670
to your new wife.

615
00:40:23,630 --> 00:40:25,480
Revealing a confidential imperial edict

616
00:40:25,480 --> 00:40:26,680
is a capital offense!

617
00:40:30,110 --> 00:40:30,760
Shen Run,

618
00:40:32,070 --> 00:40:33,800
I've already made a concession.

619
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:35,460
As long as Chen Qingyuan dies,

620
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:38,140
I'll pretend none of this ever happened.

621
00:40:38,320 --> 00:40:39,550
What good would

622
00:40:40,320 --> 00:40:41,480
killing Chen Qingyuan do for us

623
00:40:41,480 --> 00:40:42,920
or for His Majesty's

624
00:40:43,320 --> 00:40:44,280
plans?

625
00:40:45,440 --> 00:40:46,900
Are you defying the edict?

626
00:40:47,230 --> 00:40:47,840
Feng En,

627
00:40:49,230 --> 00:40:50,670
you and I fought together
in the Northern Frontier

628
00:40:50,670 --> 00:40:51,960
for years,

629
00:40:52,400 --> 00:40:53,730
through life and death.

630
00:40:54,070 --> 00:40:56,230
Are you really going to
turn your sword against me?

631
00:40:56,230 --> 00:40:57,400
I'm not like you.

632
00:40:58,280 --> 00:41:00,340
I know very well that I'm just a blade.

633
00:41:00,510 --> 00:41:01,630
In the Northern Frontier,

634
00:41:01,630 --> 00:41:03,510
I was the general's sharpest weapon.

635
00:41:03,510 --> 00:41:04,370
In the capital,

636
00:41:04,800 --> 00:41:06,200
I'm His Majesty's blade.

637
00:41:06,400 --> 00:41:07,710
Whoever I serve,

638
00:41:08,150 --> 00:41:09,010
my blade points

639
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:10,670
where they direct.

640
00:41:10,920 --> 00:41:12,840
Even with brotherly bonds between us,

641
00:41:12,840 --> 00:41:15,070
when the moment comes
that I must take your life,

642
00:41:15,070 --> 00:41:17,320
I'll show no mercy whatsoever.

643
00:41:27,110 --> 00:41:28,970
As long as it's not Chen Qingyuan.

644
00:41:31,230 --> 00:41:32,430
If you want to kill me,

645
00:41:33,400 --> 00:41:34,000
so be it.
